WEBVTT

00:05.770 --> 00:11.990
W. Whewell

00:12.700 --> 00:14.490
Thanks, Hirata-kun.

00:16.490 --> 00:20.390
Kushida-san... is a traitor?

00:21.000 --> 00:25.590
There shouldn't have been a way to
figure out the VIP in the last test.

00:26.370 --> 00:31.630
And I can't imagine you or Hirata would
have revealed that she was the VIP.

00:32.250 --> 00:33.630
Of course not.

00:33.630 --> 00:35.370
You really are amazing!

00:33.630 --> 00:38.300
But what if Kushida herself revealed it?

00:39.460 --> 00:40.920
Impossible.

00:40.920 --> 00:43.140
There'd be nothing in it for her.

00:43.360 --> 00:45.290
We can't say that for sure.

00:45.940 --> 00:49.400
Perhaps she was receiving private
points from another class.

00:49.400 --> 00:53.280
You think she sold out
her own class for points?

00:53.280 --> 00:55.830
There are any number of possibilities.

00:54.840 --> 00:59.710
Me, too! I'm going to do my best!

00:56.710 --> 00:59.270
But only Kushida herself knows the reason.

01:01.860 --> 01:06.290
Is finding that out the reason you
want to bring the two of us together?

01:06.290 --> 01:09.920
You and Kushida appear to have a history.

01:10.170 --> 01:11.400
I...

01:12.360 --> 01:15.380
A class that houses a
traitor can't possibly win.

01:17.340 --> 01:21.650
If you want to lead the class,
you'd better think about it.

02:54.440 --> 02:58.020
<b>2nd Season</b>

02:54.440 --> 02:58.020
<b>Classroom of</b>

02:54.440 --> 02:58.020
<b>the Elite</b>

03:00.600 --> 03:03.030
C'mon, louder! I can't hear you!

03:03.290 --> 03:04.550
This was a pleasant surprise!

03:04.550 --> 03:07.850
You never ask me out, Ayanokoji-kun.

03:07.850 --> 03:09.160
I suppose not.

03:09.420 --> 03:13.170
Watching the other classes
is kind of exciting, isn't it?

03:13.170 --> 03:14.510
I suppose.

03:14.920 --> 03:18.380
You <i>can</i> be a little nasty,
though, Ayanokoji-kun.

03:19.920 --> 03:24.430
You know that Horikita-san
doesn't like me much, right?

03:26.430 --> 03:29.560
This was Horikita's idea, actually.

03:29.560 --> 03:32.760
Really? What a surprise!

03:32.760 --> 03:36.570
Kushida-san, I have no interest in you.

03:37.310 --> 03:39.690
What a mean thing to say!

03:39.690 --> 03:42.150
But I want to ask you one thing.

03:42.150 --> 03:46.670
The one who leaked VIP information
to Ryuen-kun on the ship...

03:47.220 --> 03:48.200
Was it you?

03:51.710 --> 03:54.780
<i>I knew she wouldn't try to sugarcoat it,</i>

03:55.290 --> 03:56.940
<i>but that was harsher than I expected.</i>

03:57.460 --> 03:59.230
You don't have to admit it.

03:59.230 --> 04:00.650
It's in the past, after all.

04:00.650 --> 04:01.970
What are you

04:01.970 --> 04:06.600
But as a member of your class, I'm not
sure if I can trust you from now on.

04:06.890 --> 04:09.640
I don't know why you suspect me,

04:09.640 --> 04:12.630
but I want to work to reach
Class A with the rest of you.

04:13.180 --> 04:15.100
You'll trust me, won't you?

04:16.690 --> 04:17.780
Very well.

04:20.180 --> 04:22.530
I can't wait for the sports festival!

04:23.610 --> 04:26.530
Yeah! I'm gonna get you next time!

04:26.530 --> 04:30.630
<i>Third-year girls, the 100 meter
dash is about to begin.</i>

04:27.620 --> 04:31.640
<b>Sports Festival Day</b>

04:31.090 --> 04:34.870
<i>Students, please gather at the
designated start location.</i>

04:34.870 --> 04:36.880
It's been goin' pretty well so far!

04:36.880 --> 04:39.460
Now, let's win this sports festival!

04:39.460 --> 04:41.320
Show me what all your training's been for!

04:41.320 --> 04:44.760
I'm gonna sweep all the events I'm a part of!

04:44.760 --> 04:47.780
And I don't wanna see any
of you guys placing last!

04:45.090 --> 04:47.780
He seems to have placed great faith in us...

04:47.780 --> 04:50.060
But there's no way we can win everything.

04:47.780 --> 04:50.470
Don't get spooked if you fall behind!

04:50.470 --> 04:52.370
Hang in there like your life depends on it!

04:52.370 --> 04:53.730
You hear me?!

04:53.730 --> 04:57.730
Anyway, you guys seen how
hard I'm owning this?

04:58.730 --> 05:02.370
Take a page outta my book and
really put your backs into it!

05:01.700 --> 05:02.700
What the heck?

05:02.700 --> 05:05.620
He's like a little kid showing
off in front of his crush.

05:07.140 --> 05:08.120
Is that...

05:08.990 --> 05:10.940
Sakayanagi Arisu-san.

05:10.940 --> 05:13.500
One of the two central figures of Class A.

05:13.940 --> 05:17.000
She's Team Red like us this time,
so it'll be good to have her.

05:21.050 --> 05:23.010
How are things proceeding?

05:23.010 --> 05:25.020
Well enough, I suppose.

05:25.020 --> 05:27.140
How is Class D's performance?

05:27.490 --> 05:30.030
Mostly below average.

05:30.030 --> 05:32.510
Sudo Ken is the only standout.

05:32.840 --> 05:35.890
His achievements are raising team morale.

05:35.890 --> 05:37.230
I see.

05:37.230 --> 05:39.030
Just as anticipated.

05:40.500 --> 05:43.590
Okay, let's keep this up and sweep this thing!

05:43.590 --> 05:45.160
Follow my lead!

05:45.160 --> 05:46.810
Yeah!

05:51.280 --> 05:55.290
<b>Team White</b>

05:51.280 --> 05:55.290
<b>Team Red</b>

05:52.570 --> 05:54.320
It's a promising start.

05:54.320 --> 05:57.480
Yes, thanks to you and Sudo.

05:57.480 --> 06:00.650
You did well against that
track-and-field club ace.

06:02.170 --> 06:04.170
<b>Third-Year Boys   100 Meter Dash</b>

06:06.190 --> 06:07.490
So cool!

06:06.190 --> 06:08.180
<b>1st Place
Horikita Manabu</b>

06:08.180 --> 06:11.110
The student council president
is truly impressive.

06:11.890 --> 06:14.250
My brother? He's perfect.

06:14.250 --> 06:16.310
He wins at everything he does.

06:16.310 --> 06:17.900
Dang, he's fast.

06:19.170 --> 06:21.150
Damn it, Koenji!

06:21.150 --> 06:24.180
It's go time, and you're sittin' it out?!

06:24.180 --> 06:25.650
Quit screwin' around!

06:25.880 --> 06:28.530
First her, and now you...

06:28.530 --> 06:31.660
It seems you can't do anything without me.

06:31.890 --> 06:33.280
"She"?

06:33.800 --> 06:36.530
The cool girl who's got you all fired up.

06:36.940 --> 06:39.920
She begged me to engage
earnestly in the events.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.540
<i>Horikita did?</i>

06:41.770 --> 06:44.290
But I'm terribly sorry to say...

06:44.290 --> 06:47.040
I'm feeling under the weather today.

06:47.040 --> 06:48.550
You son of

06:48.550 --> 06:50.350
It's almost the next event!

06:50.350 --> 06:53.050
You're our leader! It'll hurt
team morale if you're not there!

06:54.510 --> 06:55.680
Fine!

06:56.930 --> 06:58.010
Asshole!

06:58.970 --> 07:02.430
Hey! If any of you guys skip out,
you'll get an earful from me.

07:03.340 --> 07:05.030
That's uncomfortable.

07:05.030 --> 07:06.440
It's scary!

07:06.440 --> 07:08.570
I fear I must relieve myself.

07:11.570 --> 07:13.210
Go for it!

07:11.570 --> 07:14.580
<b>First-Year Boys  Topple the Pole</b>

07:12.630 --> 07:13.890
Win this one!

07:13.890 --> 07:15.150
Go!

07:14.580 --> 07:16.580
<b>Team Red Defense
Class 1-A</b>

07:15.150 --> 07:16.580
Put your backs into it!

07:16.580 --> 07:18.580
<b>Team White Defense
Class 1-B</b>

07:17.950 --> 07:19.090
Fight!

07:18.580 --> 07:20.580
<b>Team White Offense
Class 1-C</b>

07:19.090 --> 07:21.270
Get that pole down!

07:20.580 --> 07:23.080
<b>Team Red Offense
Class 1-D</b>

07:21.950 --> 07:23.080
Let's do this!

07:23.080 --> 07:24.270
Awright!

07:24.270 --> 07:26.960
You wanna die? Come right for me!

07:27.730 --> 07:28.840
Hold Sudo off!

07:33.540 --> 07:34.850
They all came after me?!

07:34.850 --> 07:36.350
Bad news, Ken!

07:41.350 --> 07:42.850
Stand off!

07:42.850 --> 07:43.930
Damn it!

07:43.930 --> 07:46.060
What's wrong with those Class A losers?

07:52.130 --> 07:53.990
You pieces of

07:54.990 --> 07:56.330
Damn it!

07:58.700 --> 08:00.250
You

08:03.210 --> 08:05.460
Victorious.

08:06.490 --> 08:09.590
Ryuen... That's against the rules!

08:09.590 --> 08:12.340
Oh, you're there?

08:12.650 --> 08:14.330
I didn't even notice.

08:16.020 --> 08:17.270
Are you all right?

08:17.830 --> 08:20.230
That jackass! I'll beat the shit out of him!

08:20.230 --> 08:22.770
You can't do that. It'll make trouble.

08:22.770 --> 08:24.850
So it's only okay when they attack <i>us</i>?!

08:24.850 --> 08:27.870
It'll likely be taken as
an accident during play.

08:28.210 --> 08:30.170
Ryuen's clever like that.

08:30.930 --> 08:32.990
There goes our sweep...

08:32.990 --> 08:37.120
I'm sorry. We let you down on defense.

08:37.120 --> 08:39.230
That's okay. We both made mistakes.

08:39.230 --> 08:42.250
Nah, he's right! You guys let us down!

08:42.250 --> 08:44.230
Are you even trying?!

08:45.210 --> 08:46.450
Look at that!

08:46.450 --> 08:47.750
Was it a collision?

08:49.030 --> 08:50.130
Horikita?!

08:50.980 --> 08:51.630
Is she okay?

08:51.900 --> 08:52.900
What happened?

08:53.630 --> 08:56.130
I'm gonna get a first aid kit!

08:56.130 --> 08:57.820
I'll tell the teachers.

09:03.100 --> 09:04.270
Does it hurt?

09:04.270 --> 09:06.800
It won't affect my performance.

09:06.800 --> 09:08.020
If I just rest it a little...

09:10.010 --> 09:11.620
Don't you touch

09:11.620 --> 09:14.660
This will absolutely affect your performance.

09:14.660 --> 09:18.130
I'm more concerned about
Kinoshita-san right now.

09:18.130 --> 09:20.530
The Class C girl you collided with?

09:20.530 --> 09:23.660
I can't help but feel like
she did it on purpose.

09:25.660 --> 09:30.540
Regardless, you should keep your
focus on your own events. Not me.

09:30.540 --> 09:33.150
I hear you talked to Koenji.

09:35.420 --> 09:38.180
Though it was pointless in the end.

09:38.890 --> 09:40.820
Perhaps if I was like Kushida-san,

09:40.820 --> 09:44.150
beloved by all around me,
it would have gone differently.

09:45.060 --> 09:49.820
I never thought I'd hear about you
wanting to be more like Kushida.

09:50.760 --> 09:54.660
I didn't always hate her, you know.

09:56.870 --> 09:58.930
Don't tell anyone I said this.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.820
Regardless,

10:01.290 --> 10:02.940
you shouldn't push yourself too hard.

10:02.940 --> 10:04.200
I'm fine.

10:04.740 --> 10:06.220
I'll be there, even if I have to crawl.

10:06.830 --> 10:09.330
<b>First-Year Girls
Piggyback Joust</b>

10:12.610 --> 10:14.340
To the right! Keep going!

10:16.340 --> 10:19.710
The Class C girls are totally
targeting Horikita, aren't they?

10:19.710 --> 10:22.490
Damn it! I bet Ryuen's behind this!

10:24.520 --> 10:25.600
Got it!

10:25.600 --> 10:26.480
We won!

10:39.210 --> 10:41.470
Ken! You're up!

10:41.470 --> 10:42.620
Right!

10:43.820 --> 10:46.680
How's your leg, Horikita?

10:46.680 --> 10:48.120
I'll be fine.

10:48.460 --> 10:49.470
Can I help you?

10:49.470 --> 10:51.130
Oh, well...

10:51.130 --> 10:52.510
Leave it to me!

10:52.510 --> 10:55.250
I'll fight twice as hard in your place!

10:55.560 --> 10:57.250
I'm very glad to hear it.

10:57.880 --> 10:59.080
Yeah!

10:59.080 --> 11:00.990
Let's do this, guys!

11:00.990 --> 11:03.390
We'll take that asshole Ryuen's head!

11:03.390 --> 11:05.390
<b>Team White</b>

11:03.390 --> 11:05.390
<b>Team Red</b>

11:03.390 --> 11:05.390
<b>First-Year Boys
Piggyback Joust</b>

11:05.390 --> 11:10.470
<i>It started out well, with Sudo
cooperating with Class A, but...</i>

11:15.520 --> 11:18.280
<i>He fell for Ryuen's provocations,</i>

11:18.280 --> 11:19.780
<i>lost his cool,</i>

11:21.450 --> 11:23.060
<i>and then just lost.</i>

11:25.280 --> 11:28.060
That son of a bitch cheated!

11:28.530 --> 11:30.260
There's no point in reporting him.

11:30.260 --> 11:32.540
I know that, okay?!

11:32.540 --> 11:33.700
Damn it!

11:35.670 --> 11:40.050
<b>2nd Season</b>

11:35.670 --> 11:40.050
<b>Classroom of</b>

11:35.670 --> 11:40.050
<b>the Elite</b>

11:40.050 --> 11:45.430
<b>Team White</b>

11:40.050 --> 11:45.430
<b>Team Red</b>

11:41.810 --> 11:44.930
We've completely lost our early lead.

11:45.450 --> 11:46.920
Hey, Kiyotaka.

11:46.920 --> 11:48.450
Are we in trouble?

11:48.450 --> 11:49.560
Why do you ask?

11:49.880 --> 11:52.810
And... did you just call me by my given name?

11:52.810 --> 11:56.190
I've started calling Hirata-kun "Yosuke-kun,"

11:56.190 --> 11:57.870
so I figured I'd do the same with you.

11:59.320 --> 12:03.070
And, wow... Horikita-san's in bad shape, huh?

12:03.640 --> 12:06.400
They're targeting her, after all.

12:06.400 --> 12:10.030
You mean it's not just a coincidence
that she keeps getting paired up

12:10.030 --> 12:11.960
with tough opponents?

12:12.210 --> 12:13.250
Correct.

12:13.640 --> 12:15.140
And it's not just Horikita.

12:15.510 --> 12:19.090
Our class participation list was leaked.

12:19.460 --> 12:20.710
Leaked?

12:20.710 --> 12:21.600
Yes.

12:21.600 --> 12:25.090
The traitor leaked it. To Ryuen.

12:28.090 --> 12:30.720
He's trying to do two things.

12:31.490 --> 12:35.480
One is to pit powerhouses like Sudo
up against his weakest players,

12:35.900 --> 12:38.980
and everyone else up against
someone just slightly superior,

12:38.980 --> 12:41.150
to rack up overall wins.

12:41.990 --> 12:46.110
The other is... to completely crush Horikita.

12:46.350 --> 12:47.870
No way...

12:47.870 --> 12:54.750
<b>Team White</b>

12:47.870 --> 12:54.750
<b>Team Red</b>

12:48.700 --> 12:52.010
Class D is probably in last
place right now, right?

12:52.010 --> 12:54.260
Do we have any chance left to win?

12:54.750 --> 12:55.810
Win?

12:56.700 --> 12:59.250
I had no intention of winning from the start.

13:00.680 --> 13:04.810
The most important thing right
now is not to do anything.

13:06.070 --> 13:09.970
Our goal in this sports festival
is to lose as much as possible.

13:10.550 --> 13:13.140
That will empower us later.

13:13.140 --> 13:15.020
What in the world?

13:20.250 --> 13:23.530
That Ryuen bastard's cheatin' his ass off!

13:23.790 --> 13:25.780
I'm gonna beat the shit out of 'im!

13:26.180 --> 13:27.630
Calm down!

13:27.630 --> 13:30.780
If you attack him,
that's when it's really over!

13:30.780 --> 13:32.200
Shaddap!

13:32.200 --> 13:35.170
Listen up, Hirata! I'm the
leader for the sports festival.

13:35.170 --> 13:36.170
You do what I say!

13:36.170 --> 13:37.390
I know that...

13:37.390 --> 13:39.420
But look around you.

13:39.420 --> 13:43.170
How many people will acknowledge you
as leader with the way you're acting?

13:46.620 --> 13:48.020
What's with you guys?!

13:48.020 --> 13:51.020
I'm bustin' my ass for this class!

13:51.020 --> 13:52.600
Are you really?

13:55.180 --> 13:57.590
I think you just want to hog the spotlight

13:57.590 --> 14:00.670
and prove to everyone how amazing you are.

14:01.880 --> 14:03.610
You shut your

14:03.610 --> 14:05.970
We're all counting on you, Sudo-kun!

14:05.970 --> 14:08.910
Please, look at the bigger picture!

14:08.910 --> 14:10.200
Shaddap!

14:11.110 --> 14:12.990
I know you can do this.

14:13.300 --> 14:14.200
So please

14:14.200 --> 14:16.480
I said <i>shut up</i>!

14:19.770 --> 14:20.900
Hirata!

14:22.630 --> 14:23.800
Hirata-kun...

14:23.800 --> 14:25.760
Disgusting.

14:25.760 --> 14:28.510
What's all this? What happened?

14:28.510 --> 14:31.810
Oh... I just tripped.

14:31.810 --> 14:33.180
Everything's fine.

14:33.760 --> 14:36.220
It doesn't look that way to me.

14:36.220 --> 14:39.850
But if that's the victim's testimony,
I won't pry further.

14:45.650 --> 14:47.070
I'm out!

14:47.070 --> 14:48.950
Screw the sports festival!

14:48.950 --> 14:52.630
What are we supposed to do without you?!

14:52.630 --> 14:54.810
Let that loser go.

15:04.510 --> 15:07.850
<i>After a fifty-minute break period,</i>

15:07.850 --> 15:09.770
<i>we'll begin the afternoon's events.</i>

15:13.650 --> 15:17.810
You're going to ask me to bring
Sudo-kun back, aren't you?

15:17.810 --> 15:19.640
If you already know, you don't have to ask.

15:20.230 --> 15:22.710
If he doesn't come back
before the afternoon events,

15:22.710 --> 15:24.560
we'll have no hope of recovery.

15:25.270 --> 15:27.720
He won't listen to me.

15:28.200 --> 15:32.650
And I'm in no condition to
show understanding to others.

15:32.650 --> 15:35.450
How long do you intend to
remain utterly useless?

15:36.700 --> 15:38.200
What do you mean by that?

15:38.200 --> 15:39.840
Exactly what I said.

15:39.840 --> 15:42.890
You're useless, so I called
you useless. That's all.

15:42.890 --> 15:44.220
I resent that.

15:44.220 --> 15:47.670
I'm much more useful than
those incompetents around me!

15:47.670 --> 15:49.970
I just keep suffering
these unlucky accidents.

15:49.970 --> 15:51.550
Unlucky?

15:52.040 --> 15:55.210
Do your injuries, and Class D's
current predicament,

15:55.210 --> 15:57.460
really strike you as coincidence?

15:57.460 --> 15:59.040
Don't insult me!

15:59.040 --> 16:03.100
Even I know it's probably some
scheme on Ryuen-kun's part.

16:04.180 --> 16:07.970
But... that doesn't mean
I can do anything about it.

16:07.970 --> 16:12.110
You're missing your chance
to acquire a weapon.

16:12.110 --> 16:13.180
A weapon?

16:14.110 --> 16:15.780
What I mean is,

16:15.780 --> 16:19.120
there are limits to how well you'll
be able to fight alone in the future.

16:19.490 --> 16:22.840
In fact, you're helpless on
your own at this very moment.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.370
You...

16:24.370 --> 16:27.550
You need a weapon at your personal disposal.

16:28.580 --> 16:32.710
Sudo Ken could be an indispensable
part of your arsenal.

16:33.190 --> 16:35.510
Use him, as I use you.

16:36.950 --> 16:39.890
What should your priority be at this moment?

16:40.370 --> 16:42.610
Praying that your wound heals?

16:43.210 --> 16:44.270
I don't think so.

16:45.700 --> 16:46.830
I...

16:47.520 --> 16:50.140
You can think the rest over yourself.

17:00.390 --> 17:03.410
So who's the traitor, anyway?

17:03.410 --> 17:05.930
I wish you'd tell me already.

17:06.990 --> 17:08.740
I'm afraid I can't tell you.

17:08.740 --> 17:10.800
Huh?! How come?

17:11.500 --> 17:14.500
But if you knew there'd be a traitor,

17:14.500 --> 17:17.550
why did you submit the
leaked submission form?

17:18.510 --> 17:19.660
I dunno.

17:19.980 --> 17:22.920
Horikita told me to do it,
so you might wanna ask her.

17:22.920 --> 17:23.860
So...

17:24.310 --> 17:27.940
Where is Horikita-san right now, exactly?

17:28.990 --> 17:32.330
Doing something that only she can do.

17:38.020 --> 17:39.130
There you are!

17:39.130 --> 17:40.660
Horikita-san!

17:42.040 --> 17:44.770
Yes? Can I help you?

17:44.770 --> 17:45.540
Yeah.

17:45.540 --> 17:49.300
It turns out the girl you
ran into, Kinoshita-san...

17:49.300 --> 17:51.450
She's really badly hurt!

17:52.460 --> 17:56.720
Now they want you to come
to the nurse's office!

17:58.430 --> 17:59.670
Very well.

18:08.700 --> 18:10.530
Hey, Suzune.

18:10.940 --> 18:13.630
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

18:13.630 --> 18:16.690
Kinoshita here was just
telling me everything.

18:17.060 --> 18:20.450
I can't believe you did that to her.

18:20.680 --> 18:22.450
What exactly are you implying?

18:23.390 --> 18:27.580
Kinoshita says you knocked
her over on purpose.

18:27.580 --> 18:29.260
On purpose?

18:29.260 --> 18:30.710
Don't be absurd!

18:30.710 --> 18:34.360
After I fell, you said to me...

18:34.730 --> 18:37.090
"I'll never let you win."

18:37.820 --> 18:39.030
You're lying.

18:39.030 --> 18:40.980
I never said anything like that!

18:40.980 --> 18:42.450
Get real, now.

18:42.450 --> 18:44.850
Is this the kind of injury
that happens at random?

18:48.980 --> 18:53.320
You're a cold-hearted woman
to do something like this.

18:54.360 --> 18:56.160
Did you arrange this?

18:56.160 --> 18:58.110
Don't you have any shame?

18:58.110 --> 19:01.910
Blaming me to cover up
your own wrongdoing...

19:02.340 --> 19:04.490
What a nasty girl you are.

19:05.050 --> 19:08.610
<i>It's very difficult to prove a lack of intent.</i>

19:08.970 --> 19:12.130
<i>Probatio diabolicaĐ²Đ‚â€The Devil's Proof.</i>

19:13.250 --> 19:17.630
Kinoshita's going to tell
the school about this.

19:17.860 --> 19:19.130
How can you...

19:21.630 --> 19:23.770
If you think you've been falsely accused,

19:23.770 --> 19:26.060
why don't we have our day in "court"?

19:26.060 --> 19:27.520
<i>I...</i>

19:27.750 --> 19:30.840
<i>I can't make trouble for my brother.</i>

19:31.810 --> 19:33.870
Please, Ryuen-kun!

19:33.870 --> 19:38.510
I don't think Horikita-san is the kind of
person who'd hurt someone on purpose.

19:38.510 --> 19:39.690
Kushida-san...

19:39.920 --> 19:44.450
Isn't there any way to just
resolve this ourselves?

19:44.780 --> 19:48.700
I'll be happy to strike a deal...
under certain conditions.

19:50.420 --> 19:53.260
A million points, Suzune.

19:54.380 --> 19:57.060
For a million points,
the complaint goes away.

19:57.570 --> 20:01.280
It seems like appropriate restitution to me.

20:01.280 --> 20:04.490
Don't be absurd. Is this what you were after?

20:04.490 --> 20:06.600
Why you cooked up that little story?

20:06.600 --> 20:07.960
I see...

20:08.380 --> 20:12.070
It looks like I'll have to tell
the student council, then.

20:14.280 --> 20:14.980
Wait!

20:17.860 --> 20:22.720
If I pay one million points,
this all goes away?

20:22.720 --> 20:23.850
Yes.

20:23.850 --> 20:26.180
But I'm sorry to say..

20:26.180 --> 20:28.900
"One million" is no longer
the offer on the table.

20:29.220 --> 20:30.120
What?

20:30.120 --> 20:32.410
You shouldn't have turned
down my first offer.

20:34.510 --> 20:36.130
Now, let's see...

20:36.390 --> 20:38.230
On top of the points,

20:39.330 --> 20:40.880
I now want you to grovel.

20:41.820 --> 20:44.050
You're perverse.

20:44.050 --> 20:48.180
I won't force you to decide right now.

20:48.760 --> 20:52.180
I'll take my answer after
the sports festival is over.

21:01.410 --> 21:02.750
<i>That was careless of me...</i>

21:03.640 --> 21:06.270
<i>I fell right into his trap.</i>

21:24.090 --> 21:29.960
I'm aware of the position Class D has ended
up in at this year's sports festival.

21:32.140 --> 21:34.620
I'm keenly aware of my own incompetence.

21:35.820 --> 21:37.900
But don't worry.

21:39.650 --> 21:42.370
I won't make any trouble for you, Brother.

21:47.970 --> 21:50.690
<i>He feels no sympathy for me.</i>

21:51.160 --> 21:53.910
<i>But he did stop.</i>

21:54.660 --> 21:56.510
<i>That's enough for now.</i>

22:01.560 --> 22:07.130
<i>There's one last thing I can
do for this sports festival.</i>
